。我当时脑子里全是，学生家长会不会觉得这个老师很奇怪，同事看到了会怎么想。唉，我是不是太在意别人的眼光了？<第9轮:让你的回答保持简短，限制每次回复中的信息量，字数限制在100字左右。一次提出一个问题，不要分点描述。>","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":18,"responseSource":"agent:llm","promptTraceId":"468323d5971d44bdaeb2a8d397bbc231","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.012424864787775653,"emotions":[],"relationId":"6affb790d2fb32051dbd20cd","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1795143568528,"createTime":"2026-11-20 10:59:28","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":{"emotion":{"type":"悲观","keywords":["不安","焦虑","自我怀疑","担忧","矛盾"],"originalText":["最近……就是总觉得情绪不太对，有时候会突然想哭。但具体为什么，我也说不上来，就是感觉很乱。","晚上吧……一个人的时候特别容易胡思乱想。","我有点担心。","我不想让他们觉得我……不太正常。其实我是不是有点太敏感了？","我当时特别尴尬，就觉得……我怎么连这个都控制不住。","应该是……别人怎么看我吧。","最怕……被否定吧。","我好像总是在两边拉扯。"]},"conversation":{"type":"情绪调节","topic":"情绪波动、自我怀疑与在意他人评价带来的心理压力"}},"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null},{"pageNum":0,"pageSize":0,"id":"6affb786d2fb32051dbd209d","chatId":"055454d7059b4ea58d5e45e23f57c71d","sessionId":null,"userId":129615,"orgId":3721,"botId":1030,"isGreeting":false,"role":"role","content":"这并不代表你失控，更像是你被他的难过真切触动了，尴尬很正常。你当时最担心的是他，还是别人怎么看你？","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[{"content":"这并不代表你失控，更像是你被他的难过真切触动了，尴尬很正常。你当时最担心的是他，还是别人怎么看你？","options":null,"isShow":true,"label":"","evaluate":"","takingTime":2518,"promptTokens":149,"completionTokens":184,"responseSource":"agent:llm","censorData":{"labels":null,"words":null},"createTime":"2026-11-20 10:59:18"}],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":17,"responseSource":"agent:llm","promptTraceId":"9f08ffdafdfa45ff8e15cbca9560cfe8","isSuicide":false,"is